  "content": "[Intro]\n[D#]\n[Fm7]\n[D#]\n[Fm7]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[D#]Some day, when\n[Fm7]I'm awfully low\n[Gm7]When the world is cold\n[Fm7]I will feel a glow just thinking\n[D#]of you\n[Fm7]And the way you [A#7]look tonight\n[D#]  [Fm7]\n[D#][A#7]Yes, you're\n\n[Verse 2]\n[D#]lovely,\n[Fm7]with your smile so warm\n[Gm7]And your cheeks so soft\n[Fm7]There is nothing for me but to\n[D#]love you\n[Fm7]And the way you [A#7]look tonight\n[D#]  [Fm7]\n[D#]  [A#7]\n\n[Chorus]\n[F#]With each word your\n[G#m7]tenderness [C#7]grows\n[F#]Tearin' my [F]fear\n[G#m7]apart\n[A#m7]And that laugh [A]\n[G#m7]wrinkles your nose [C#7]\n[F#]Touches my [A#]foolish\n[Fm7]heart\n\n[Verse 3]\n[D#]Lovely\n[Fm7]Never, never change Keep\n[Gm7]that breathless charm\n[Fm7]Won't you please arrange it? 'Cause\n[D#]I love you\n[Fm7]Just the way you [A#7]look tonight\n[D#]\n\n[Interlude]\n[F#]\n[G#m7]  [C#7]\n[F#]  [F]\n[G#m7]\n[A#m7]And that [A]laugh\n[G#m7]that wrinkles your [C#7]nose\n[F#]It touches [A#]my foolish\n[Fm7]heart\n\n[Chorus]\n[E]Lovely\n[F#m7]Don't you ever change\n[G#m7]Keep that breathless charm\n[F#m7]Won't you please arrange it? 'Cause I\n[E]love you\n\n[Outro]\n[F#m7]Just the way you [B7]look tonight\n[E]Mm, Mm,\nMm, Mm,\n[F#m7]Just the way you [D#]look to-\n[E]night",
